    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base class for landscape data sources. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_path_source" kindref="compound">PathSource</ref> represents any source of information used to define landscape features, including moisture sources, obstacles, resource distributions, and habitat domains. Derived classes must implement methods for displaying information and identifying the source type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
